    <description>When a Payment is created or changed to Paid, and its method is not Credit, resolves the landlord User through the Payment tenancy and property, then submits the payment to the Rent Payment Approval process. The approval process sets Pending Approval, Received, or Rejected.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
